      "content": "i know... people always say \"reach out\" or \"it gets better\" but that just feels like more effort, you know? more talking, more explaining, more trying to fix something that feels fundamentally broken. i’m not even looking for a fix anymore. i'm just so done with the constant struggle of existing. it feels like i've been running a marathon for years and there's no finish line in sight.",
